## Scope of the Research Claims

This work is a **formal research paper**. No independent empirical benchmarking of AetherGit has been conducted. The architectural benchmarks (30,000+ merges/day, 1.5–4.0s checkout latency, 99.4% cache hit ratio, 200x CPU reduction) are derived from formal analysis and comparison with published figures for Git, Piper, and Sapling/Mononoke. They are **architectural benchmarks, not independently verified empirical results**.

